# Decisions with reopen conditions (spec 1.2)
Four decisions a team writes down once and the tools read every time. A person sets the weights and scores; the tool only adds them up. Example data.

// 规范版本: lnd-1.1 · 键名语言: zh · 范围: example · 建议视图: 网页, 看板, 源码

---

@来源 f-interviews
标题: Ten customer interviews, notes
网址: https://example.org/interviews
日期: 2026-10-12
@@

@来源 f-confidence-method
标题: How the confidence of d-price was computed: 7 of 10 interviews chose one-time (0.7), set by a person
日期: 2026-10-19
@@

@断言 c-one-time
文本: Seven of ten small teams prefer a one-time payment to a subscription.
来源: f-interviews
确定性: 假设
@@

@决策 d-price
问题: Which price model ships at launch?
选项: One-time 89 · Monthly 9
标准: Fits what customers said | 3 | 4 | 2
标准: Predictable revenue | 2 | 2 | 4
标准: Simple to explain | 1 | 4 | 3
选定: One-time 89
得分: 18/30
候选集: One-time 89 · Monthly 9
置信度: 0.7
状态: 已定
日期: 2026-10-19
来源: @(c-one-time) · @(f-confidence-method)
重开条件: fewer than 20 sales in the first 30 days after launch
@@

@决策 d-memory-policy
问题: Which memory goes into the agent's context?
选项: Rule-based ranking · Most recent first
标准: Certainty (Verified 1, Assumed 0.5) | 4 | 5 | 2
标准: Uses | 3 | 4 | 1
标准: Recency | 2 | 3 | 5
标准: Topic match (applies_to) | 1 | 4 | 2
选定: Rule-based ranking
状态: 已定
日期: 2026-10-20
重开条件: the memory-to-input ratio is above 0.5 for two weeks in a row
@@

@决策 d-next-build
问题: What do we build first after the validator?
选项: Context ranking · Import from chat history · Stale-memory report
标准: Users asked for it | 3 | 5 | 3 | 2
标准: Effort (5 = least) | 2 | 3 | 2 | 4
标准: Unblocks the next stage | 2 | 5 | 2 | 1
状态: 待定
@@

@决策 d-hosting
问题: Where does the public demo run after launch?
选项: Static host · Own server · Both
候选集: Static host · Own server
状态: 弃权
重开条件: we have one week of real traffic numbers after launch
@@

@任务 t-ranking
标题: Context ranking with a token budget
状态: 待办
优先级: 高
依赖: d-next-build
负责人: team
